      "eyebrow": "TO KEEP · ANTHOLOGY ARTIST",
      "artistName": "Daisy German",
      "artistTitle": "Illustrator, Symbolic Animals",
      "bio": "I start with the meaning. Before I draw an animal, I spend time looking into the symbolism, stories and qualities that have become attached to it — strength, patience, resourcefulness, belonging, whatever I find there. That research shapes the way I draw, exaggerate and simplify each character, using a bold, Nordic-inspired lino print style. I work from Birmingham, making animals that hopefully feel familiar at first glance, but carry a little more underneath.",
